        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVrPE8duQPkXXfgnRjQIVONT41TNf2_BigVSpQK2UN3_D1RNzzn=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "The food was delicious! We tried a variety of things and they were all amazing. The staff was incredibly nice as well. We will 100% be back. There are a few tables to sit and eat inside too. The floors are a little slippery so be careful!",
        "time": 1768690498,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Diego Caruana",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114790387547666378288/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV0Udcj6-OyVl8m-KM5mw84xrho2i8Du6U3agxAK16uk7W3iHeD=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 weeks ago",
        "text": "God bless this place. I just tried the birria and shrimp tacos, both were absolute fire. I no longer need to make my way to Montreal to scratch my taqueria itch.\nPuts Carlos and Pepe’s to shame. I will be back soon.",
        "time": 1768783910,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Lillian Chevrier",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115063799472793556591/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWQ_Q5y_ZYBM1Q4x3pI4dPTrWTktg93RI_b-QXLq0mTnSSgjwc=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 weeks ago",
        "text": "Beautiful atmosphere, friendly staff and great food! Guacamole is super fresh, can’t wait to be back!",
        "time": 1769890137,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Caroline Di Lullo",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108270264567867311904/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLZ_LvRcB_R9KkWCpT0qKtJDf7DoMZyjfkNNb3Kq1xJLUJwEA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 weeks ago",
        "text": "This new family-run authentic Mexican restaurant in Vaudreuil is an absolute gem! The food was outstanding—so flavourful and clearly made with love. You can really taste the authenticity in every bite.\n\nThe staff was incredibly friendly and welcoming; a mom and her two sons were working together, which made the experience even more special. You instantly feel at home.\n\nI recommend this place to everyone—hands down the best Mexican food in the area! We will definitely be back.",
        "time": 1769140943,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Ioana Varlan",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107004001826717085316/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIMTNU319St87kJ8ol7sq-6c4ngf-i2sCwiCGFW6EQrnz_IpJDz=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 weeks ago",
        "text": "Vaudreuil area needed this. I needed this. FINALLY good Mexican food in Vaudreuil area. THANK GOD. Got the whole pizza box of all the tacos and they were all great. The cochinita pibil was my fav very wow, chorizo was also big hit. See you probably weekly let’s be honest and thankyouthankyou for setting up shop here please never leave.",
        "time": 1769813054,
        "translated": false
      }
